  passengerName: Ivan Solovei
  portrait: {fileID: 6937817954938267909, guid: 6bcd3a7c7fdf97a41b192aecb3b00903, type: 3}
  healthPoints: 100
  charDescription: Ivan Solovei is a man in his forties clearly mark by great stress.
    His small round glasses bearly hide the fleeing but hard eyes of the man. Talking
    to Ivan firstly show that he is not a great team player, and seems a bit cold
    with people, staying in his corner. The truth about him is that he's a quisling
    that led many to their death. At the time, he did it mostly by fear of death,
    but he now regrets very much what he did and is not far mentally from suicide.
    The discovery of his secret may lead to a catastrophy, wich could happen if he
    is recognised by someone or if he is found by the defensive forces, but in the
    meantime he know how to talk to officers of the occupying force.
  bonus:
  - anti social
  - collabo
  - stresse
